```

In this example, we create a `TextField`, set its `columns` property to 2, and add some sample text to it. The text will automatically be formatted to display in two columns based on the specified width. You can adjust the `width` property to fit your specific requirements. This approach should help you achieve the desired columnar text display in Adobe Animate.

